.TH SDL_GetTrayEntryLabel 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetTrayEntryLabel \- Gets the label of an entry.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_tray.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetTrayEntryLabel(SDL_TrayEntry *entry);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
If the returned value is NULL, the entry is a separator\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I entry
the entry to be read\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the label of the entry in UTF-8 encoding\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should be called on the thread that created the tray\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

